*~
*#
.*
# The ".*" rule above also ignores .github/, .nojekyll, .dockerignore and even
# .gitignore/.gitattributes themselves. Re-include them so "git add ." does not
# silently skip the deployment files (verified: without these lines, a fresh
# "git init && git add ." stages 138 files but none of the dotfiles).
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/deploy.yml
!.nojekyll
!.dockerignore
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
update.*.json
strings/last-strings.json
node_modules/*
docs
dist
*.map